// Shared Slack Bot connector for care-team escalation.
//
// Used by the miraEscalation function to post exception alerts to the
// care-team Slack channel when severity is 'escalate'. Care team members
// see only operational signal (posture, valence, surface) — never chat
// content or PHI.
//
// To authorize: run `base44 connectors push` and complete the OAuth flow.
// The bot needs chat:write scope to post to the configured channel.
{
  "type": "slackbot",
  "scopes": [
    "chat:write",
    "channels:read"
  ]
}
